"settings.about.history.v353.build51.recovery" = "An inganta tantance jimlar dawo da walat, sauya manyan haruffa zuwa ƙanana, shigarwa mai lambobi, sharewa, gogewa ta riƙe maɓallin baya da aikin madannai. Shafukan dawo da walat yanzu suna da maɓallin komawa guda ɗaya.";
"settings.about.history.v353.build51.send" = "An ƙara hanyoyin madadin ƙiyasta kuɗin mu’amala a duk hanyoyin sadarwar da ake tallafawa idan ba a samu ƙiyasi ba. Ana ɓoye adiresoshin kwangila yayin aikawa kuma ana nuna kuɗin a fili.";
"settings.about.history.v353.build51.security" = "An fayyace bitar izini, bayanan adiresoshi, sakamakon soke izini da jagorar ƙara kuɗin caji. Katunan ajiyar baya da bangarori suna amfani da salo iri ɗaya. An cire jijjiga yayin sauya shafuka.";
