"settings.about.history.v354.build55.interface" = "An inganta dacewa da iOS 27, tsarin dama zuwa hagu, jagorar mai karɓa, fassara da aikin madannai. Shafin karɓa yana nuna Avalanche C-Chain kuma yana bayyana memo na Stellar da Gram. An cire bayanan Wikipedia.";

"settings.about.history.v354.build55.send" = "Shafin dubawa yana bincika kuɗin mu’amala, yana ba da damar saka tsabar asalin hanyar sadarwa kuma yana daidaita adadin aikawa domin biyan kuɗin. Sarrafa tsabar kuɗi yana nuna nau’in adireshi da shigarwar da aka zaɓa. An inganta loda Solana, aika Sui da tarihin Sui a tsofaffin nau’in iOS.";

